     A* CRMDASHD - Live dashboard (27 x 132)
     A* Create with WAITRCD(2): the program WRITEs DASH (INVITE) and READs
     A* the file. If no key is pressed within 2 seconds the READ times
     A* out (status 1331) and the program refreshes the data.
     A* Lines 9-14 and 17-25 carry embedded 5250 color attributes.
     A                                      DSPSIZ(27 132 *DS4)
     A                                      INDARA
     A                                      CA03
     A                                      CF05
     A                                      CF07
     A                                      CF08
     A                                      CF09
